Simple Rule
What you want to do	Where?
Write Python code	✅ VS Code Editor
Save the file	✅ VS Code (Ctrl + S)
Install libraries (pip install ...)	✅ Ubuntu Terminal
Run the program (python3 ...)	✅ Ubuntu Terminal
Create folders (mkdir)	✅ Ubuntu Terminal
